      "term": "Tunisian simple stitch",
      "definition": "Forward pass: insert hook under each vertical bar, pull up loop. Return pass: yarn over, draw through 2 loops at a time until 1 loop remains. Produces a woven grid surface."
    },
    {
      "slug": "tunisian-bind-off",
      "term": "Tunisian bind-off",
      "definition": "A final row of sl st worked across all vertical bars to close off the last forward pass and make a neat edge."
    },
